# CLAUDE.md

This file provides guidance to Claude Code (claude.ai/code) when working with code in this repository.

## What this specimen is

`<SPECIMEN>` is a new CT specimen in the glass-bead / ice compression
series. Bead diameter 1700 µm nominal, "T5_HR" = high-roughness glass (same
material as `<SPECIMEN>`), "75" is the specimen ID. Voxel size
throughout the series is **24.7660229 µm**.

Three scans are already present (`<SPECIMEN>_01..03/`, slices
0000–1127 each). This gives **two compression transitions** (1→2 and 2→3) —
structurally between the T7 pipeline (4 scans, 3 transitions) and the T5_HR
pipeline (2 scans, 1 transition).

